TEXT -216 488 Left 2 ;To test: run with +5 connected. Should see ~2.5V on output. This voltage is from +5.\nThen, disconnect +5 and run. Still see ~2.7V at output \n(used 5.5V for USB_VCC so difference was distinguishable). This voltage is from the USB_VCC.
